            <ArticleTitle>Pelvic pain complicating LHRH analogue treatment of fibroids.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>383-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present these 3 cases to alert others to the possibility of severe pain with rapid shrinkage of fibroids occurring during LHRH analogue treatment. We suggest management of such events should not be surgical except for vaginal excision of prolapsed fibroid polyps.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
